u + 1 / 0 => error: undefined u
1 / 0 + u => error: division by zero
1 / 0 + 99999999999999999999 => error: division by zero
99999999999999999999 + 1 / 0 => error: overflow
2 ^ -1 / 0 => error: negative exponent
0 / 0 => error: division by zero
0 % 0 => error: division by zero
5 % 0 => error: division by zero
-17 / 5 => -3
-17 % 5 => -2
17 / -5 => -3
17 % -5 => 2
-17 / -5 => 3
-17 % -5 => -2
